<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://sjorsverhaak.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://sjorsverhaak.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2025-08-15T18:34:35+00:00</updated><id>https://sjorsverhaak.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>Doctoral Candidate in Political Theory at Cornell University. Thinking Earth. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">Trip to Shanay-timpishka, Amazonia</title><link href="https://sjorsverhaak.github.io/blog/2023/Pucallpa/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Trip to Shanay-timpishka, Amazonia"/><published>2023-10-11T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2023-10-11T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://sjorsverhaak.github.io/blog/2023/Pucallpa</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://sjorsverhaak.github.io/blog/2023/Pucallpa/"><![CDATA[ <div class="position-relative mb-4"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div style="position:absolute; bottom:12px; left:16px; right:16px; color:#fff; text-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.6); font-weight:600; font-size:1.25rem;"> Journey along the Ucayali — From Pucallpa to the Shinay-timpishka </div> </div> <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.4;"> <blockquote> &ldquo;The Boiling River regularly reaches 86C &ndash; with drastic consequences for the surrounding rainforest.<br/><br/> When you drive towards Peru&#39;s Boiling River, along a bumpy, four-hour track through the rainforest, it&#39;s only after you transcend a crest in the landscape that you see it ahead of you, says Alyssa Kullberg, a postdoctoral researcher in plant ecology at the Swiss Federal Technology Institute of Lausanne (EPFL). Huge billows of steam rise from a clutch of trees in the wide, saucer-like depression below.<br/><br/> &quot;It was so magical,&quot; says Kullberg, remembering the first time she saw it with her own eyes. The Boiling River, also known as the Shanay-timpishka, is part of a tributary in east-central Peru that connects to the mighty Amazon River.&rdquo; </blockquote> </div> <p style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;"> <a href="https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20241210-how-the-amazons-boiling-river-foreshadows-climate-change" target="_blank">🔗 Read the full BBC Future article here</a> </p> <div class="row g-4 mt-2"> <div class="col-12 mt-4"> <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="card-img-top"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/boiling-river-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/boiling-river-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/boiling-river-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/boiling-river.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="card-body py-3"> <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-0"><em>Boiling River</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 mt-4"> <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="card-img-top"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/near-boiling-river-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/near-boiling-river-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/near-boiling-river-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/near-boiling-river.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="card-body py-3"> <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-0"><em>Near Shanay-timpishka</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="card-img-top"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="card-body py-3"> <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-0"><em>On the Ucayali</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="card-img-top"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/ucayali-from-above-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/ucayali-from-above-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/ucayali-from-above-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/ucayali-from-above.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="card-body py-3"> <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-0"><em>Ucayali from Above</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="card-img-top"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/new-shanay-river-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/new-shanay-river-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/new-shanay-river-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/new-shanay-river.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="card-body py-3"> <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-0"><em>Boiling River</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm"> <div class="card-img-top"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="card-body py-3"> <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-0"><em>Sreya in Pucallpa Market</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="trips"/><category term="travel"/><category term="Amazon"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A short photo story]]></summary></entry></feed>